OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely sunny, dry and warm
OL,6,Fthis morning, just a small chance of
OL,7,Fan isolated light shower or two.
OL,8,FTurning breezier and cloudier from the
OL,9,Fnorth during the afternoon, with
OL,10,Fperiods of rain edging southwards. The
OL,11,Fsouth probably staying dry. Humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWidely cloudy with periods of
OL,14,Frain overnight, perhaps a few heavier
OL,15,Fbursts in places and winds easing.
OL,16,FFeeling warm and muggy.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FCloudy and wet at first. Drier
OL,19,Fand brighter by the afternoon but with
OL,20,Fa few showers. Lighter winds than
OL,21,FSaturday but still feeling humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
