OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,6,Ffine, bright to start Monday, becoming
OL,7,Fvery warm. Occasional rain, stronger
OL,8,Fwinds developing later. Cooler by
OL,9,FTuesday, with bright or sunny spells
OL,10,Fand briefly gusty winds. Similar on
OL,11,FWednesday.
